class:: PipeWirePort
summary:: A single port on the PipeWire graph
categories:: External Control>PipeWire
related:: Classes/PipeWire, Classes/PipeWirePatch, Classes/PipeWireLink

description::

A value object describing one PipeWire port, as returned by
link::Classes/PipeWire#*outPorts:: / link::Classes/PipeWire#*inPorts:: and the
port accessors of link::Classes/PipeWirePatch::. Pass link::#-fullName:: to
link::Classes/PipeWire#*connect:: / link::Classes/PipeWire#*disconnect::.

ClassMethods::

method:: new
argument:: id
argument:: fullName
argument:: node
argument:: port
argument:: direction
returns:: a PipeWirePort.

InstanceMethods::

method:: id
The PipeWire port id (an link::Classes/Integer::).

method:: fullName
The full code::"node:port":: name, as accepted by pw-link.

method:: node
The owning node's code::node.name::.

method:: port
The port name within the node (e.g. code::"output_AUX0"::).

method:: direction
code::\output:: or code::\input::.

Examples::

code::
~p = PipeWire.outPorts.first;
~p.node;
~p.port;
~p.fullName;
~p.direction;
::
